      "title": {
        "en": "Enthusiastic playtime and pack hikes"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners frequently note that their pets get excited as soon as they reach the car park, eagerly anticipating social playtime and outdoor trail hikes. Dogs return home happily exhausted after active days. While two reviews raised health concerns about a dog falling ill and smelling soiled after boarding, the vast majority praise overall pet care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and attentive daycare attendants"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly commend the staff for knowing dogs by name, showing genuine affection, and providing thorough daily report cards and social media updates. Long-standing patrons describe the team as responsive and knowledgeable. Although one customer disputed boarding oversight, feedback remains overwhelmingly complimentary."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Spacious facility with outdoor adventures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the clean, expansive facility in Pacific Beach, frequently highlighting the structured indoor play zones and off-site hiking excursions. Patrons value smooth check-ins and thoughtful evaluation days for new dogs. One client noted dissatisfaction with kennel conditions after an extended stay, contrasting with regular cleanliness praise."
      }
    }
  ],
